WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:10.780
How popular is the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act, 
Donald Trump's 2017 signature law,

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.580
and has it given the president a boost in the polls?

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:19.220
Very few pollsters ask people regularly about the law. The Economist/YouGov poll is an exception.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.540
They've asked about it virtually every week
since passage, and the ratings are stable,

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.820
with opinion usually tilting slightly against the law.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:30.280
In their latest online poll, 34 percent supported it

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.980
and 39 percent were opposed, with nearly
three and ten having no opinion.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.080
In a March Fox News poll, 42 percent of
registered voters approved of the way

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:43.300
President Trump is handling taxes,
while 48 percent disapproved.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:49.120
A Gallup poll from February 2019 also produced a negative verdict on Trump and taxes.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.780
Public perceptions of the economy
have been very good lately,

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:57.600
and President Trump usually gets positive marks
from a majority of the public on handling it.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.880
But rosy views about the economy are not changing in a positive way people's perceptions of the tax law.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:07.340
Nor have they boosted views of the president on handling taxes.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:12.020
What do you think about President Trump's Tax Cuts and Jobs Act?

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:17.840
Let us know in our poll. Also let us know what other topics you'd like our scholars to cover in 60 seconds

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:22.100
and be sure to LIKE and subscribe for more research and videos from AEI.

